        "text": {
          "status": "generated",
          "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p>Combined haemato-oncology pathology report for Hodor TAMESIDE. Acute myeloid leukaemia: abnormal karyotype with trisomy 8 and deletion of 7q (cytogenetic report CY26-04411), and a pathogenic somatic TP53 variant (molecular genomic report G26-50233).</p></div>"
